"Before the bullet came the breath before the"},{"s":7.16,"e":8.54,"text":"battle came the choice"},{"s":10.52,"e":13.52,"text":"before the banners battered brothers there was still"},{"s":13.52,"e":14.52,"text":"a human voice"},{"s":17.04,"e":19.7,"text":"Love is not a lack of power love"},{"s":19.7,"e":25.32,"text":"is power under poise Quiet courage cutting chaos"},{"s":26.28,"e":30.28,"text":"making mercy make more noise"},{"s":45.94,"e":49.6,"text":"Yeah yeah Bitter borders broken bridges bruised beliefs"},{"s":49.6,"e":53.26,"text":"become the flame Trauma travels thunder follows frightened"},{"s":53.26,"e":56.08,"text":"children learn the name Same blood beating same"},{"s":56.08,"e":58.66,"text":"breath breathing same bright spark beneath the skin"},{"s":58.58,"e":62.06,"text":"Still we spin through spiteful cycles strike retaliate"},{"s":62.34,"e":64.24,"text":"begin But a better battle starts by battling"},{"s":64.24,"e":65.9,"text":"the hate Grace can grip a grudge and"},{"s":65.9,"e":67.56,"text":"guide it through a kind of gate Mercy"},{"s":67.56,"e":71.08,"text":"move through midnight make your morning mutate Love"},{"s":71.08,"e":74.94,"text":"can loosen loaded fists before they seal another"},{"s":74.94,"e":80.14,"text":"fate Yeah yeah Pain makes people preach revenge"},{"s":80.32,"e":83.24,"text":"revenge repeats the pain Rockets roar the ruins"},{"s":83.24,"e":86.26,"text":"rise red rivers meet the rain What if"},{"s":86.26,"e":88.72,"text":"strength may stay a steady when the rage"},{"s":88.72,"e":91.4,"text":"invades the brain What if peace became the"},{"s":91.4,"e":94.18,"text":"prize and every person broke the chain Choose"},{"s":94.1,"e":98.66,"text":"compassion over cannons conversation over cries Choose the"},{"s":98.66,"e":101.02,"text":"courage to see humans through the hatred in"},{"s":101.02,"e":104.7,"text":"our eyes Every enemy somebody who once stared"},{"s":104.7,"e":107.66,"text":"at summer skies Every mother mourns the same"},{"s":107.66,"e":111.88,"text":"when any son or daughter dies Love louder"},{"s":112.06,"e":114.16,"text":"let it thunder through the tanks and through"},{"s":114.16,"e":117.1,"text":"the night Love longer let it linger till"},{"s":117.1,"e":120.7,"text":"the wrong remembers right Love greater break the"},{"s":120.7,"e":123.4,"text":"barricades bring broken hearts to life If we’re"},{"s":123.66,"e":125.86,"text":"brave enough to love we’re brave enough to"},{"s":125.86,"e":128.8,"text":"stop the fight No more mothers mourning mornings"},{"s":128.86,"e":131.8,"text":"no more fathers fearing phones No more children"},{"s":131.8,"e":135.18,"text":"choosing shelter sleeping scared beneath the drones Make"},{"s":135.18,"e":138.82,"text":"compassion our commander make forgiveness fill our bones"},{"s":138.84,"e":141.42,"text":"Turn the battlefield to bread lines bring the"},{"s":141.42,"e":144.72,"text":"broken soldiers home Peace is impassive peace is"},{"s":144.72,"e":147.82,"text":"pressure placed on pride Peace is pulling people"},{"s":147.82,"e":150.7,"text":"closer when the powerful say divide Peace is"},{"s":150.7,"e":153.2,"text":"seeing scared civilians on the so called other"},{"s":153.2,"e":157.14,"text":"side Peace is standing strong enough to let"},{"s":157.14,"e":160.34,"text":"humanity decide Feed instead of fight heal instead"},{"s":160.34,"e":162.06,"text":"of hate Fun to feel the future’s not"},{"s":162.06,"e":163.86,"text":"a funeral at the gate Trade the threats"},{"s":163.86,"e":166.08,"text":"for treaties turn attention toward a fate Written"},{"s":166.08,"e":170.38,"text":"not by rage or rulers but by people"},{"s":170.38,"e":172.58,"text":"who create"},{"s":174.16,"e":176.66,"text":"Love does not mean weakness love means looking"},{"s":176.66,"e":179.82,"text":"at what’s true That the child across the"},{"s":179.82,"e":182.62,"text":"border wants a bedtime story too That the"},{"s":182.62,"e":185.24,"text":"soldier under orders may be scared of losing"},{"s":185.24,"e":188.36,"text":"you And beneath the flags and factions fragile"},{"s":188.36,"e":189.88,"text":"hearts are beating through"},{"s":192.08,"e":193.86,"text":"History remembers armies"},{"s":195.3,"e":197.62,"text":"humanity remembers those who refused to become what"},{"s":197.62,"e":198.1,"text":"they hated"},{"s":199.8,"e":201.68,"text":"The hand that lowers a weapon may shake"},{"s":203.2,"e":203.9,"text":"let it shake"},{"s":206.02,"e":207.72,"text":"Courage was never the absence of fear"},{"s":208.96,"e":211.64,"text":"Sometimes courage is seeing the face across the"},{"s":211.64,"e":218.68,"text":"field And deciding you will not make another"},{"s":218.68,"e":224.36,"text":"mother mourn mourn mourn mourn More bread less"},{"s":224.36,"e":228.38,"text":"blood more trust less threat More hands held"},{"s":228.38,"e":232.36,"text":"high with no hatred left More grace less"},{"s":232.36,"e":236.2,"text":"graves more peace less pain Let love become"},{"s":236.2,"e":240.44,"text":"the language every nation learns again Let the"},{"s":240.44,"e":245.24,"text":"heavens hear humanity unite Love the stranger till"},{"s":245.24,"e":248.86,"text":"the stranger feels like life Bring the broken"},{"s":248.86,"e":251.9,"text":"back from bitterness and spite If we’re brave"},{"s":251.86,"e":254.26,"text":"enough to love we’re brave enough to stop"},{"s":254.26,"e":256.98,"text":"the fight Let the piano pound like heartbeats"},{"s":257.06,"e":260.4,"text":"let the violins ignite Let a billion voices"},{"s":260.4,"e":263.22,"text":"rise and make the darkest doctrine bright Not"},{"s":263.22,"e":265.92,"text":"through vengeance not through violence not through proving"},{"s":265.92,"e":269.48,"text":"who is right But through radical compassion turning"},{"s":269.48,"e":272.58,"text":"war away tonight"},{"s":274.02,"e":277.3,"text":"One day our descendants may ask what ended"},{"s":277.3,"e":278.1,"text":"the wars"},{"s":279.24,"e":281.2,"text":"May we tell them not a greater weapon"},{"s":281.72,"e":284.18,"text":"not a richer nation not a louder threat"},{"s":284.26,"e":287.54,"text":"We remembered the person standing across from us"},{"s":288.72,"e":290.02,"text":"Was a person"},{"s":291.54,"e":292.1,"text":"And love"},{"s":293.54,"e":300.4,"text":"Patient Powerful Persistent love Became stronger than fear"}],"duration":319.561,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-09-07T18:21:15.540Z","stats":{"whisperWords":632,"polishedWords":632,"matched":632,"matchRate":1}}